<main class="rc-center">
  <div class="rc-window flow-window">
    <div class="rc-window-bar">
      <span class="rc-dot rc-dot--red"></span>
      <span class="rc-dot rc-dot--yellow"></span>
      <span class="rc-dot rc-dot--green"></span>
      <span class="rc-window-title">✦ Inicio</span>
      <%- include('../partials/window-nav', { active: 'home' }) %>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-body home-body">

      <%# ── Greeting (animated salutation: /js/home/salutation.js) ── %>
      <div class="hero-title">
        <h1 class="hero-greeting">Hola <span id="salutationText" class="animated-salutation">Hermosa</span> ♡</h1>
        <p class="home-message">Esta es la actualización de nuestro aniversario!</p>
      </div>

      <%# ── Flowers + anniversary counter (/js/home/counter.js) ── %>
      <section class="home-counter-wrap" aria-label="Tiempo juntos">
        <%# Fan of flowers: all pivot on the same point above the counter.
             The center one goes last so it stays on top %>
        <div class="home-flowers" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="home-flower home-flower--outer" style="--home-flower-angle:-58deg">🌷</span>
          <span class="home-flower home-flower--outer" style="--home-flower-angle:58deg">🌷</span>
          <span class="home-flower home-flower--mid" style="--home-flower-angle:-29deg">🌸</span>
          <span class="home-flower home-flower--mid" style="--home-flower-angle:29deg">🌸</span>
          <span class="home-flower home-flower--center">🌹</span>
        </div>

        <div class="home-counter-stage">

          <%# Small flowers and hearts around the counter (decorative) %>
          <span class="home-counter-deco" style="top:6%;left:0;animation-delay:0s"          aria-hidden="true">🌸</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco home-counter-deco--heart" style="top:42%;left:3%;animation-delay:.8s"   aria-hidden="true">♥</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco" style="bottom:4%;left:1%;animation-delay:1.6s"    aria-hidden="true">🌼</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco home-counter-deco--heart" style="top:4%;right:2%;animation-delay:.4s"   aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco" style="top:40%;right:0;animation-delay:1.2s"      aria-hidden="true">🌷</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco home-counter-deco--heart" style="bottom:6%;right:3%;animation-delay:2s" aria-hidden="true">♥</span>
          <span class="home-counter-deco home-counter-deco--heart" style="bottom:-4%;left:46%;animation-delay:1s" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>

          <div class="home-counter" id="homeCounter">
            <div class="home-counter-row home-counter-row--date">
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="years">0</span><span class="home-counter-label">Años</span></div>
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="months">0</span><span class="home-counter-label">Meses</span></div>
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="days">0</span><span class="home-counter-label">Días</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-counter-row home-counter-row--time">
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="hours">00</span><span class="home-counter-label">Horas</span></div>
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="minutes">00</span><span class="home-counter-label">Minutos</span></div>
              <div class="home-counter-unit"><span class="home-counter-value" data-counter-unit="seconds">00</span><span class="home-counter-label">Segundos</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <%# ── Letter ──
           Replace the paragraphs below with the letter.
           Wrap the special text in <span class="home-letter-highlight"> to show it in red. ── %>
      <article class="home-letter">
        <p>Hola mi linda Nico ♡</p>
        <p>Bienvenida a nuestra actualización de <span class="home-letter-highlight">aniversario</span>, espero te gusten los nuevos toques aqui y alla.</p>
        <p>Hace ya <span class="home-letter-highlight">un año</span> que estamos juntos amor mio. Ha sido un maravilloso año lleno de aventuras nuestras, de risas, 
          besos, lagrimas, chistes, abrazos, pero sobre todo <span class="home-letter-highlight">amor.</span> </p>
        <P>Agradezco cada dia haberte conocido, y poder estar en tu vida. <span class="home-letter-highlight">Eres la persona más maravillosa para mi.</span></P>
        <p>Hace poco escuche que el amor era "estar extaciado por la existencia del otro". Hoy quiero decirte que <span class="home-letter-highlight">asi me siento contigo</span>,
          cada dia mientras yo tenga aliento, tendre la voluntad y el deseo de estar para ti, de hacer mi dia un poco más atareado por hacer el tuyo
          más fácil. Quiero hacer todo lo que pueda para ver una sonrisa en tu hermoso rostro, por que eso es lo que me causas a mi a diario.
        </p>
        <p>Hoy, mañana y ayer; bajo el sol, la luna o las estrellas; en la tormenta o en la calma; en el reino de los cielos o la ciudad de los fantasmas; <span class="home-letter-highlight">Te Amo</span>.</p>
        <p class="home-letter-signature">— Tuyo, Rodrigo ♡</p>
      </article>

      <%# ── Anniversary photo (/js/home/photo.js) ── %>
      <figure class="home-polaroid">
        <div class="home-photo" id="homePhoto" data-csrf="<%= csrfToken %>">

          <%# Empty state: click to upload %>
          <button type="button" class="home-photo-empty" id="homePhotoAdd" <%= photoUrl ? 'hidden' : '' %>>
            <span class="home-photo-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">📷</span>
            <span>Haz clic para agregar nuestra foto ♡</span>
          </button>

          <img class="home-photo-img" id="homePhotoImg" alt="Nuestra foto de aniversario"
               <% if (photoUrl) { %>src="<%= photoUrl %>"<% } else { %>hidden<% } %> />

          <%# Change photo (only with a photo) %>
          <button type="button" class="home-photo-change" id="homePhotoChange" aria-label="Cambiar foto" title="Cambiar foto" <%= photoUrl ? '' : 'hidden' %>>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="17 1 21 5 17 9"/>
              <path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/>
              <polyline points="7 23 3 19 7 15"/>
              <path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/>
            </svg>
          </button>

          <div class="home-photo-loading" id="homePhotoLoading" hidden>Subiendo foto...</div>
        </div>

        <figcaption class="home-polaroid-caption">Nuestro Primer Aniversario ❤️</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <input type="file" id="homePhotoInput" accept="image/*" hidden />
      <p class="rc-alert rc-alert--error home-photo-error" id="homePhotoError" role="alert" hidden></p>

      <p class="rc-divider" aria-hidden="true">✦ ♡ ✦</p>

      <%# ── Future dates (/js/home/calendar.js) ── %>
      <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="futureDatesTitle">
        <h2 class="home-section-title" id="futureDatesTitle">Futuras citas:</h2>

        <div class="rc-calendar home-calendar" data-home-calendar>
          <div class="calendar-header">
            <button type="button" class="calendar-nav" data-calendar-nav="prev" aria-label="Mes anterior">‹</button>
            <span class="calendar-label" data-calendar-label></span>
            <button type="button" class="calendar-nav" data-calendar-nav="next" aria-label="Mes siguiente">›</button>
          </div>

          <div class="calendar-grid" data-calendar-month></div>

          <div class="calendar-legend">
            <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot legend-dot--busy1"></span> Día con cita</span>
            <span class="legend-item">Pasa el cursor sobre el día ♡</span>
          </div>

          <%# Enlarged day with the details (filled by calendar.js) %>
          <div class="home-day-card" id="homeDayCard" role="tooltip" hidden></div>
        </div>

        <% if (upcomingDates.length === 0) { %>
          <p class="rc-subtitle">No hay citas futuras todavía ♡</p>
        <% } %>
      </section>

    </div><%# /flow-body %>
  </div><%# /rc-window %>
</main>

<%# Future dates for calendar.js. "<" is escaped so a name can not close the script tag %>
<script>
  window.upcomingDates = <%- JSON.stringify(upcomingDates).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %>;
</script>
<script src="/js/home/salutation.js"></script>
<script src="/js/home/counter.js"></script>
<script src="/js/home/photo.js"></script>
<script src="/js/home/calendar.js"></script>
